409		The \emph{type graph} $G^{\mathrm{pauli}}$ has vertex set $\mathcal T^{\mathrm{pauli}}$ and the following edges: all $18$ edges of the Magic Square type graph $G^{\mathrm{ms}}$ (Definition~\ref{def:ms-game}); the edges
410		\begin{align*}
