419		% The type pair is drawn from the graph distribution of Definition
420		% def:graph-distribution, matching the source's formal definition
421		% (references/qpbt-paper/07_types.tex:84-93 together with
422		% references/qpbt-paper/08_classical_and_quantum_low_degree_tests.tex:1115-1120).
